<title>UK: M.A.I.D. shares jump after annual results.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D. shares jump after annual results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in M.A.I.D. Plc jumped on Thursday after the British information provider announced annual results in line with expectations and said it expected to be profitable in 1997.</p>
<p>M.A.I.D. posted a 1996 pre-tax loss of 7.0 million stg. Its shares were marked up 12-1/2p to 185 by 0824 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;They were optimistic about this year and the shares have been marked up on the back of that,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
